SpiderMonkey on NeoSymbian (armv7a-symbian-eabi: EKA2 at AArch32 EL0 with P.I.P.S.), interpreter only, no Intl
(NeoSymbian/browser WB3, docs browser-js.md): a mozbuild OS "Symbian" (__symbian__), GC chunks in a disconnected
RChunk (gc/MemorySymbian), mozglue/misc/SymbianOS (stack, random, threads, logging), and P.I.P.S. gaps
(no pthread_rwlock, condattr_setclock, unsetenv's result, locale). Every change is behind __symbian__ or
OS_ARCH == "Symbian".

